{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_2000_situation", "source_sha256": "2e0a36fc02736ca93866af981101571c147ca1aced8575c7f158f901a137cbdb", "ja": "サイン会のお仕事中", "zh": "签名会工作中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_2000_place", "source_sha256": "2eac3a40fc07710d441025c7f019e77f8c451a36bc6677b154f3b53ed164681e", "ja": "イベント会場", "zh": "活动会场", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_2001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1ad3f9b0ed2ed48c0e3bbde106fd2b9595e9f3e7d76c07f3e3db7c2e037b6ece", "ja": "このたびは私のサイン会にお越しくださり、\nまことにありがとうございました。", "zh": "诚心感谢你拨冗莅临\n我的签名会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_2002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ae2a66e94971dcf28af3b808c4936ada32676e4ff47ff99d934888effe36dfe6", "ja": "たいへん恐縮ですが、どうぞこちらをお納めください。\nそれでは、次にお待ちの方……え？", "zh": "实在是非常惶恐，但还请收下这个。\n接着，排在下一位的客人……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_2003_p", "source_sha256": "6ce2f56c6ee6de158c0c26b09145575a16d67a8f5a2b9eaca640ff80db0f5b45", "ja": "すみません、ここで一度、休憩とさせていただきます。\n紬、ちょっとこっちに……。", "zh": "不好意思，现在先进入中场休息。\n䌷，过来一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_2004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e826f8e064db5fac35bf5de1e54facce4b8e18c86742e16ea7e1ed098350c4d1", "ja": "{$P$}？\nあの……何か、問題がありましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}？\n请问……有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_2005_p", "source_sha256": "de8fb63542665b9e5371c909259bd912f29603b3bd8d76aa8cc54c645520e9fe", "ja": "問題はないよ。ファンの人達に丁寧なのはいいんだ。\nただ、もうちょっとフランクにできないかな？", "zh": "没有问题，对粉丝谨慎有礼是件好事，\n但态度能不能再直接一点呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_2006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "82cb39f082e0e1c4aa85166da9d5536563739f8baf2e88c0538067b0b04b8783", "ja": "そ……、粗雑な対応をしろとおっしゃるのですか？\nわざわざ私のために来てくださった方々に？", "zh": "你……你是希望我表现出马虎的态度吗？\n对专程为我而来的各位？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_2007_p", "source_sha256": "e24d98ea040e4090d3226f39ce99b38c08429c04b48035c1290ce28c0d5b210f", "ja": "そうじゃなくて。お客さん達は紬が好きなんだから、\n紬の笑顔が見たいはずだなって。", "zh": "不是这样的，我是觉得客人们都这么喜欢䌷，\n应该会想看见䌷的笑容吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_2008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6453e331032b19a4c37c424cf36306c3b5ded5e2141036fbcddd180a9c6291f0", "ja": "す……っ。", "zh": "喜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_051tmg_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_051tmg_2009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "13f9ed6ffcdd278ca99225ed62a3ccb3f1a484bb3770ca63c23fbcd61b59eb4c", "ja": "いえ……すみません。つい、緊張してしまって。\n笑顔……わかっています。あの……善処します。", "zh": "不……对不起，方才我不知不觉就太紧张了。 笑容……我了解的，那个……我会妥善应对的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
